22: {'E': 7.2, 'P': 8.1, 'L': 5.8, 'E_Expl': 'Establishes credibility through confidence and strong conviction in American values and workers.', 'P_Expl': "Appeals to emotions by mentioning Main Street suffering, the American worker, and the nation's potential under the right leadership.", 'L_Expl': 'Uses logical reasoning to discuss the necessity of regulatory reform and addresses existing problems in the system.', 'E_clauses': {'1': 'I have a fundamental belief in the goodness and strength of the American worker.', '2': 'But I have a fundamental belief in the United States of America.', '3': 'And I still believe, under the right leadership, our best days are ahead of us.'}, 'P_clauses': {'1': 'No, I — look, we’ve got to fix the system.', '2': 'Main Street is paying a penalty for the excesses and greed in Washington, D.C., and in the Wall Street.', '3': 'But we’ve got to get through these times,'}, 'L_clauses': {'1': 'We’ve got fundamental problems in the system.', '2': 'And, obviously, stricter interpretation and consolidation of the various regulatory agencies that weren’t doing their job, that has brought on this crisis.', '3': 'America is still the greatest producer, exporter and importer.'}}
24: {'E': 8.0, 'P': 7.5, 'L': 8.5, 'E_Expl': "The speaker establishes credibility by discussing their experience and referencing a fellow senator's perspective.", 'P_Expl': 'The speaker elicits feelings of frustration and dissatisfaction with wasteful government spending.', 'L_Expl': 'The speaker presents logical arguments and factual evidence to support their stance on controlling government spending.', 'E_clauses': {'clause_1': 'We Republicans came to power to change government, and government changed us.', 'clause_2': 'my friend, Tom Coburn, calls earmarking as a gateway drug, because it’s a gateway.'}, 'P_clauses': {'clause_1': 'We have former members of Congress now residing in federal prison because of the evils of this earmarking and pork-barrel spending.', 'clause_2': 'You know, we spent $3 million to study the DNA of bears in Montana.'}, 'L_clauses': {'clause_1': 'It’s gone — we have now presided over the largest increase in the size of government since the Great Society.', 'clause_2': 'He has asked for $932 million of earmark pork-barrel spending, nearly a million dollars for every day that he’s been in the United States Senate.'}}
